  "tip": [
    {
      "id": "p1",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": "keep 主要有以下三种用法："
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "p2",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": "1) keep sth. + 形容词使某物保持某种状态"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "p3",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": "2) keep a dog (= raise a dog) 养一只狗"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "p4",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": "3) keep doing sth. 继续做某事"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "p5",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": "keep 作为常考单词，常出现在保持句意基本不变的句型或词语转换练习中，所以学生一定要知道：keep doing 与 go on doing/didn’t stop doing 意思相同，在句中可以互换。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "p6",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": "例如：Jimmy "
        },
        {
          "t": "underline",
          "v": "kept talking with"
        },
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": " others in the Maths lesson yesterday."
        },
        {
          "t": "br"
        },
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": "= Jimmy "
        },
        {
          "t": "underline",
          "v": "went on/didn’t stop talking with"
        },
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": " others in the Maths lesson yesterday."
        },
        {
          "t": "br"
        },
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": "在昨天的数学课上，吉米一直在与他人讲话。"
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
